WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A number on a product page can feel like proof. Twelve hertz. Eighteen hertz.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But a frequency is a description of a sound, not a measurement of your concentration.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers have studied auditory stimulation, sometimes finding promising effects, sometimes not.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The details matter: headphones, stimulus type, control sound, and the task being measured.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Even an interesting study may test a different technique from the one a seller uses.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before you buy an outcome, ask what the exact recording was tested against. Start with one free twelve-minute task.
